SQL Notes — String & Date/Time Functions
Built for data transformation, analysis, manipulation and cleaning of data. Examples use dbo.customers, Sales.Orders, and Sales.Employees.

1. Types of Functions
Single-row functions take one value in and return one value per row; multi-row (aggregate/window) functions take many values in and return one overall result. Nested functions chain outputs into inputs.

