        ▼                                          ▼
┌──────────────────┐                      ┌──────────────────┐
│  SINGLE-ROW      │                      │  MULTI-ROW       │
│  input: 1 value  │                      │  input: N values │
│  output: 1 value │                      │  output: 1 value │
└────────┬─────────┘                      └────────┬─────────┘
         │                                         │
   ┌─────┼──────────────┬──────────────┐            │
   ▼     ▼              ▼              ▼            ▼
String  Numeric    Date & Time      NULL      • Aggregate (SUM, AVG…)
                                                  • Window (LAG, OVER…)
Nested functions — the output of one function is the input of the next:

Left(Trim(first_name), 2)      -- Trim runs first, then Left
value ──► Trim ──► Left ──► result
        (inner)   (outer)      -- innermost executes first
